    "talentLevels": "Mona input 0 through 14 selects levels 1 through 15; 165 index and level pairs match the local parameter tables within 0.00011, allowing for the release kernel's displayed ratio precision.",
    "c6": "The structured rule produces 0.15 for electro-charged, bloom, lunar-charged, lunar-bloom and lunar-crystallize; full moonsign adds 0.20. The supplied recipient-on-field false yields no effects. Actual transformative calls check electro-charged and bloom and exclude hyperbloom, burgeon and overload.",
