  },
  "boundaries": [
    "The Mona skill catalogue contains no Aino C2 water-shot index; its absence is not proof that no other runtime path exists.",
    "The existing LeyLine C2 hit uses one explicit aggregate fact. Its input means that the on-field ally attack, nearby target, Aino being off field, active domain and five-second interval have already been satisfied; it does not itself establish an event scheduler or evaluate those predicates.",
    "The Mona C6 probe supplies a buff directly. It does not independently verify cast history, 15-second expiry, proximity or the game reaction formula.",
    "The Mona output for a 90-level Aino burst with 100 elemental mastery did not expose the official A4 flat damage addition; this is a limitation of the observed Mona path, not evidence against the official text or the LeyLine binding.",
    "Full moonsign changes burst shot interval and area according to A1; no per-shot multiplier change follows from that description. Concrete timing and range require separate evidence."
  ],
